@searchBaseUrl=http://127.0.0.1:9997
@hostBaseUrl=http://127.0.0.1:9998
@chatBaseUrl=http://127.0.0.1:9999

### GET Agent Card - Chat Agent
GET {{chatBaseUrl}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

### GET Agent Card - Host Agent
GET {{hostBaseUrl}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

### GET Agent Card - Search Agent
GET {{searchBaseUrl}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

